The idea i'm using with the french.sty distrib. is to say you will find
enclosed 2 files:
1- xxx.dvi which is how your output must look like.
2- yyy.tex which is the LaTeX file to input and process.
Then you have ...just to compare the output. Just is certainly not the
appropriate word. And the tools to help for comparison are not very
satifactory (any diff of the outputs produced by your favorite driver?
any diff on the dvi files? ...).
A very good question Rainer|
     --bg


